CERTIFICATION_TYPE {"kind":"theorem","name":"MainTheory.Orbit31FinalSameState.final_no_go","type":"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\n  (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit31.S0, c x = 0) →\n    (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit31.S1, d x = 0) →\n      SS.innerC c c = 1 →\n        SS.innerC d d = 1 →\n          SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\n            MainTheory.Orbit31CanonicalPhase.AmplitudeSupport MainTheory.Generated.Orbit31DirectTriangles.Type02.mask\n                (MainTheory.Orbit31PhaseRatios.C c) →\n              False"}
