CERTIFICATION_TYPE {"kind":"theorem","name":"MainTheory.Orbit51PrintedRows.Row01.physical_relations","type":"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\n  (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit51.S0, c x = 0) →\n    (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit51.S1, d x = 0) →\n      SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\n        Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit51.y2) * d SixQubit.Orbit51.z9 =\n            Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit51.y9) * d SixQubit.Orbit51.z2 ∧\n          Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit51.y3) * d SixQubit.Orbit51.z8 =\n              Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit51.y8) * d SixQubit.Orbit51.z3 ∧\n            Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit51.y2) * d SixQubit.Orbit51.z9 +\n                Star.star (c SixQubit.Orbit51.y3) * d SixQubit.Orbit51.z8 =\n              0"}
