CERTIFICATION_TYPE {"kind":"theorem","name":"MainTheory.OrderThreePrintedCrossRows.Orbit52.physical_half_relations","type":"∀ (c d : SS.State 6 ℂ),\n  (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit52.S0, c x = 0) →\n    (∀ x ∉ SixQubit.Orbit52.S1, d x = 0) →\n      SS.innerC c c = 1 →\n        SS.innerC d d = 1 →\n          SS.HasDistance ![c, d] 3 →\n            Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit52.y0) = Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit52.z2) / 2 ∧\n              Complex.normSq (c SixQubit.Orbit52.y1) = Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit52.z3) / 2 ∧\n                Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit52.z2) + Complex.normSq (d SixQubit.Orbit52.z3) = 1 / 3"}
